Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Undo for capslock-to-lctrl.reg: delete the "Scancode Map" value so every key
; returns to its physical meaning (CapsLock is CapsLock again). Takes effect
; after signing out or rebooting. Asks for administrator rights.
;
; This removes the whole value. If your Scancode Map also held mappings other
; than CapsLock -> Left Ctrl, re-create those instead of importing this file.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Keyboard Layout]
"Scancode Map"=-
